@FarmaApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5275

### 1. Root / Health Check
GET {{FarmaApi_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Register New Farmer
# @name registerFarmer
POST {{FarmaApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ramesh Patil",
  "email": "ramesh.farmer@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210",
  "age": 35,
  "role": "farmer",
  "city": "Pune",
  "state": "Maharashtra"
}

### 3. Register New Customer
# @name registerCustomer
POST {{FarmaApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ananya Sharma",
  "email": "ananya.customer@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "mobileNumber": "9123456780",
  "age": 28,
  "role": "customer",
  "city": "Mumbai",
  "state": "Maharashtra"
}

### 4. User Login
# @name login
POST {{FarmaApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ramesh.farmer@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### Store token from login response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 5. Get Authenticated User Profile
GET {{FarmaApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get All Farm Products
GET {{FarmaApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 7. Filter Products by Category
GET {{FarmaApi_HostAddress}}/api/products?category=Vegetables&isOrganic=true
Accept: application/json

### 8. Create Product (Farmer only)
POST {{FarmaApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Organic Alphonso Mangoes",
  "description": "Naturally ripened, chemical-free organic Alphonso mangoes from Ratnagiri orchard.",
  "category": "Fruits",
  "pricePerUnit": 450.00,
  "unit": "kg",
  "quantityAvailable": 100,
  "imageUrl": "/images/mangoes.jpg",
  "isOrganic": true
}

### 9. Create Farm Details (Farmer only)
POST {{FarmaApi_HostAddress}}/api/farms
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "farmName": "Green Valley Organic Agro",
  "location": "Ratnagiri, Maharashtra",
  "totalAcres": 12.5,
  "soilType": "Red Laterite",
  "organicCertificationNo": "NPOP/NAB/0019/2024"
}

### 10. List Farms
GET {{FarmaApi_HostAddress}}/api/farms
Accept: application/json
